order-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Weapon used to attack Goblins or Skeletons.</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.75</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ribmaul\">Ribmaul</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Ribmaul</b> is a weapon that can be found in the <a href=\"/wiki/Acidlands\" title=\"Acidlands\">Acidlands</a>, it can be used to fight mobs and drops exclusively from the <a href=\"/wiki/Skeleton_King\" title=\"Skeleton King\">Skeleton King</a>. The attack is similar to that of the <a href=\"/wiki/Rust_Breaker\" title=\"Rust Breaker\">Rust breaker</a> with heavy knockback and damage but a high cooldown, it deals slightly more damage. The large size of the weapon makes it great for clearing swarms of mobs quickly.\n</p><p>Although the drop chance is unknown it's estimated to have a drop chance of about 20%. Or about 1 in 5 kills (1/5). Similar to that of the <a href=\"/wiki/BIG_Skull\" title=\"BIG Skull\">BIG Skull</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<blockquote><p>-It is the largest weapon added to the game so far.   </p></blockquote><blockquote><p>-Due to the other items dropped from the <a href=\"/wiki/Skeleton_King\" title=\"Skeleton King\">Skeleton King</a> such as <a href=\"/wiki/BIG_Bone\" title=\"BIG Bone\">BIG Bones</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/BIG_Skull\" title=\"BIG Skull\">BIG Skulls</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Acid_Crown\" title=\"Acid Crown\">Acid Crowns</a> it can be a decent source of income, especially if one sells the Ribmaul, <a href=\"/wiki/Skull\" title=\"Skull\">BIG skulls</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Acid_Crown\" title=\"Acid Crown\">Acid Crowns</a> and other <a href=\"/wiki/Skeleton\" title=\"Skeleton\">skeleton</a> drops to other players or as a side income while trying to get <a href=\"/wiki/Trophies\" title=\"Trophies\">Skeleon Trophies</a> </p></blockquote>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163542\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.039 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 51/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 38/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019426/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   27.265      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   27.265      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:3818-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163542 and revision id 19147. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Acid Crown","exists":true},{"title":"Acidlands","exists":true},{"title":"BIG Bone","exists":true},{"title":"BIG Skull","exists":true},{"title":"Rust Breaker","exists":true},{"title":"Skeleton","exists":true},{"title":"Skeleton King","exists":true},{"title":"Skull","exists":true},{"title":"Trophies","exists":true}],"images":["Ribmaul.png"]}
